ioi-puzzle-finder

Addon for Islands of Insight with Offline Restored Mod v1.6.

Asset JSON and texture helper code is adapted from RRMod_PuzzleFix by Rushin
and contributors. The upstream MIT notice is retained in LICENSE.

Location metadata and puzzle artwork are supplied by SaveStats. Game asset
templates, modified game assets and referenced encyclopedia artwork originate
from Islands of Insight and retain their respective owners' rights. The source
code license does not grant rights to those game assets.

UAssetGUI/UAssetAPI and UnrealPak are external build tools, not included here.
The full base mod is a separately installed runtime dependency, not bundled.

